---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="General enquiries about topics covered in this guide."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p>General enquiries about topics covered in this guide.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
        <h1>聯絡</h1>
        <p>有關本指南主題的一般查詢。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div class="contact-panel">
        <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
          <p>For questions about articles or topics in this guide, leave a message below. This is an independent editorial site — not affiliated with any agency or vendor.</p>
          <div class="contact-detail"><strong>Region</strong>Hong Kong &amp; Greater Bay Area</div>
        </div>
        <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
          <p>如對本指南文章或主題有查詢，請在下方留言。本網站為獨立編輯指南，不隸屬於任何代理或供應商。</p>
          <div class="contact-detail"><strong>地區</strong>香港及大灣區</div>
        </div>
        <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="post">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name" data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">Name</label>
            <label for="name" data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">姓名</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email" data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">Your email</label>
            <label for="email" data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">你的電郵</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message" data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">Message</label>
            <label for="message" data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">留言</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" data-lang="en" class="btn btn--primary lang-block is-visible">Send enquiry</button>
          <button type="submit" data-lang="zh" class="btn btn--primary lang-block">送出查詢</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
